  "caption": "One of the easiest mistakes to make abroad is assuming the rules are the same as home.\n\nThey're not.\n\nSomething as ordinary as carrying medication, photographing a building, flying a drone, bringing food through customs or taking a souvenir home can be subject to completely different rules depending on where you are.\n\nAnd the consequences can range from a fine or confiscation to much more serious legal trouble.\n\nYou conduct. We orchestrate.\n@thevisaorchestrator",
